<title>USA: Goldman Sachs expected to issue $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs expected to issue $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co is expected to tap the corporate bond 144a private placement market with a $300 million debt offering, dealers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to include a five-year maturity with unofficial price talk seen at 50 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, dealers said.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the offering.</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
